    "Path": "src/FramePress.App/Assets/Languages/tr.json",
    "Text": "{\n  \"Tagline\": \"Videolar\u0131n\u0131z. Daha az alan.\",\n  \"Theme\": \"A\u00e7\u0131k / koyu tema\",\n  \"Queued\": \"Kuyruktaki dosyalar\",\n  \"SourceSize\": \"Kaynak boyutu\",\n  \"Saved\": \"Yedekler hari\u00e7 k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fclme\",\n  \"Source\": \"01 \u00b7 KAYNAK\",\n  \"ChooseFolder\": \"Klas\u00f6r se\u00e7\",\n  \"Recursive\": \"Alt klas\u00f6rleri dahil et\",\n  \"Scan\": \"Tara\",\n  \"SaveMode\": \"02 \u00b7 KAYDETME\",\n  \"Copies\": \"Orijinaller ve yeni kopyalar\",\n  \"Replace\": \"Yedekle ve de\u011fi\u015ftir\",\n  \"BackupHint\": \"Orijinaller kurtarma yedeklerinde tutulur. Elle silmeden \u00f6nce sonu\u00e7lar\u0131 inceleyin.\",\n  \"Destination\": \"\u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f klas\u00f6r\u00fc\",\n  \"DestinationHint\": \"Bo\u015f: kayna\u011f\u0131n yan\u0131nda. Kopyalar alt klas\u00f6rleri korur. De\u011fi\u015ftirme kaynak klas\u00f6r\u00fcnde yap\u0131l\u0131r.\",\n  \"Images\": \"G\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcleri s\u0131k\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\",\n  \"ImageHint\": \"JPEG / PNG / WebP, boyutlar korunarak WebP olur. RAW ve hareketli g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcler desteklenmez.\",\n  \"HighBit\": \"10 bit SDR \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131na izin ver\",\n  \"HighBitHint\": \"Yaln\u0131z H.265: 10 bit ve \u00fczeri SDR, 10 bit 4:2:0 olur. HDR atlan\u0131r. Kamera orijinallerini saklay\u0131n.\",\n  \"Queue\": \"Kuyruk\",\n  \"QueueHint\": \"Klas\u00f6r b\u0131rak\u0131n \u00b7 dosyay\u0131 bulmak i\u00e7in \u00e7ift t\u0131klay\u0131n\",\n  \"SelectAll\": \"T\u00fcm\u00fcn\u00fc se\u00e7 / kald\u0131r\",\n  \"Clear\": \"Kuyru\u011fu temizle\",\n  \"File\": \"Dosya\",\n  \"Status\": \"Durum\",\n  \"Profiles\": \"\u00c7\u00f6z\u00fcn\u00fcrl\u00fck profilleri\",\n  \"ProfilesHint\": \"Yatay ve dikey videolar i\u00e7in \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcn\u00fcrl\u00fc\u011fe g\u00f6re ayarlar. Boyutlar ve kare zamanlar\u0131 korunur.\",\n  \"Quality\": \"Kalite \u00b7 CRF\",\n  \"Speed\": \"H\u0131z\",\n  \"Codec\": \"Video kode\u011fi\",\n  \"QualityGuide\": \"CRF 18\u201320: y\u00fcksek kalite; 21\u201323: dengeli; 24\u201328: k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck dosyalar. D\u00fc\u015f\u00fck de\u011fer y\u00fcksek kalitedir. Sabit kalite kayb\u0131 y\u00fczdesi yoktur. Yava\u015f \u00f6nayar daha verimli s\u0131k\u0131\u015ft\u0131rabilir.\",\n  \"Activity\": \"Etkinlik\",\n  \"Guide\": \"K\u0131lavuz\",\n  \"GuideTitle\": \"\u00d6nce \u00f6rnek deneyin\",\n  \"GuideText\": \"1. Klas\u00f6r se\u00e7ip taray\u0131n.\\n2. \u00c7\u00f6z\u00fcn\u00fcrl\u00fck ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 yap\u0131n.\\n3. 20 saniyelik \u00f6rne\u011fi kurgu program\u0131nda kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n.\\n4. Kuyru\u011fu ba\u015flat\u0131p raporu inceleyin.\\n\\nUyumluluk i\u00e7in H.264 MP4. H.265 kurguyu zorla\u015ft\u0131rabilir. Orijinalleri saklay\u0131n. Hesap veya y\u00fckleme olmadan yerel i\u015fleme.\",\n  \"Limits\": \"CPU kodlamas\u0131, duraklatma/devam yok. HDR atlan\u0131r, ses AAC olur. Baz\u0131 meta veriler kaybolabilir. Teknik hatalar \u0130ngilizcedir. Tahminler kesin de\u011fildir.\",\n  \"Report\": \"CSV aktar\",\n  \"Sample\": \"20 saniyelik \u00f6rnek\",\n  \"Cancel\": \"\u0130ptal\",\n  \"Start\": \"Ba\u015flat\",\n  \"Ready\": \"Haz\u0131r\",\n  \"Scanning\": \"Taran\u0131yor\u2026\",\n  \"ScanComplete\": \"Tarama tamamland\u0131\",\n  \"Cancelling\": \"\u0130ptal ediliyor\u2026\",\n  \"Cancelled\": \"\u0130ptal edildi\",\n  \"Error\": \"Hata \u00b7 etkinli\u011fe bak\u0131n\",\n  \"NoFiles\": \"Uygun dosya se\u00e7ilmedi.\",\n  \"ChooseFolderFirst\": \"Kaynak klas\u00f6r se\u00e7in.\",\n  \"Confirm\": \"Onayla\",\n  \"ReplaceWarning\": \"Do\u011frulamadan sonra orijinaller kurtarma yedeklerine ta\u015f\u0131n\u0131r. Yedekler yer kaplar. Silmeden \u00f6nce kurgu program\u0131nda kontrol edin. Devam?\",\n  \"Encoding\": \"Kodlan\u0131yor\",\n  \"Verifying\": \"Do\u011frulan\u0131yor\",\n  \"Done\": \"Tamamland\u0131\",\n  \"LargerSkipped\": \"Daha b\u00fcy\u00fck \u00b7 atland\u0131\",\n  \"Complete\": \"Kuyruk tamamland\u0131\",\n  \"SampleEstimate\": \"Bir saat i\u00e7in: \u2248 {0} dk \u00b7 tahmini \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131: {1}. Tek \u00f6rnekten, do\u011frulama dahil; sonu\u00e7lar de\u011fi\u015fir.\",\n  \"RecoveryFound\": \"Kurtarma i\u015flemi bulundu. .framepress-transaction-*.json dosyalar\u0131n\u0131 inceleyip yeniden denemeden \u00f6nce yede\u011fi geri y\u00fckleyin.\"\n}\n"
